  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping Marine Resources Sudanese Red Sea, UNIDO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is strengthening the institutional capacities of Sudan&#x2019;s Marine Fisheries Administration through establishing manageable statistics on fish stocks in the Red Sea. Sustainable management of the fish resources will contribute to food security, diversification of the economy, thus contribute to achieving MDG1: Eradicate extreme poverty and hunger and MDG7: Ensure environmental sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
